# All knobs at both ends (pluck ignores filter and resonance), the lowest and highest notes (C0 runs at a quarter of
# the sample rate; C8 bypasses the all-pass chain), velocity 1, fast knob jumps, a full bend on a metal string.
tempo 120
steps 16
tail 0.5
track lead
preset 255 255 0 0 255 0 0 0 0 255 128 255 0 0 0 0 0 0
note 0 C0 4 127
note 4 C8 4 127
param p1 0 8
param p2 0 8
note 8 C2 4 1
param p1 255 12
param p2 255 12
note 12 G6 4 127
bend 12 200
expect peak_below -3
